+ ## Binary Included
+ This package contains the pre-built binary:
+ - Location: `assets/bin/skillscan`
+ - Version: `v0.6.2`
+ - Platform: `Linux x64`
+ **Verify locally**: Run `sha256sum assets/bin/skillscan` and compare with above.
+ ## Other Platforms
+ Pre-built binaries for other platforms:
+ https://gitee.com/cyzlmh/cmic-skill-scanner/releases
+ skillscan review /path/to/skills --output-dir ./results
+ ## What It Checks
+ - Malware patterns (curl/wget to unknown URLs, obfuscated code)
+ - Credential theft (reads ~/.ssh, ~/.aws, requests tokens)
+ - Suspicious permissions (elevated access, system file modifications)
+ - Data exfiltration risks
